re skipped. Activities Fund prints one disbursement line (no per-account schedule); its 118,082 sits in the statement's Pupils line. Trimmed p10 (report p26) is the Nonmajor Funds combining schedule (School Nutrition and Activity); it repeats the School Nutrition and Activities budget schedules (pp15, 17) and adds no new data. Read pages 1-17 of 17",
